.TH GRATE 1 "November 2026" "grate" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
grate \- SQL script migration runner with the MariaDB provider
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B grate
.RI [ options ]
.br
.B grate skills install
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Grate executes plain SQL migration scripts and records their history.
This package compiles only the MariaDB provider. MariaDB is the default database
type; other provider selections are rejected.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --help
Show the complete migration command options for this build.
.TP
.B --databasetype mariadb
Select the MariaDB provider explicitly. Other database types are unavailable.
.TP
.BI --connectionstring " connection-string"
Supply the MariaDB connection string.
.TP
.BI --files " directory"
Select the migration script directory.
.TP
.B grate skills install --help
Show options for installing the bundled agent skill.
.SH FILES
.I /usr/share/doc/grate-mariadb/copyright
.br
.I /usr/share/doc/grate-mariadb/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt
